{
    "title": "Bowling Fury: 3D Bowl Game",
    "description": "From the award-winning studio behind Darts of Fury and Ping Pong Fury, Bowling Fury is here to revolutionize the way you play 10-pin bowling on your phone/tablet. Whether you're a seasoned pro or just looking to knock down some pins for fun, our exciting new online multiplayer bowling simulator game offers a vibrant, modern take on the classic sport cherished by millions around the globe.\r\n\r\nYou've never seen a bowling game quite like this before! Head into the world of Bowling Fury and enjoy a fast-paced PvP experience like no other! \r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2022 LEAGUE MODE - Traditional rules and authentic scoring with a fresh vibrant retro look. Perfect for those who love the classic feel of the game.\r\n\u2022 SHOOTOUT - Fire up a fast-paced, head-to-head match where every strike and spare counts with a brand-new head to head scoring system designed for thrill-seekers. It\u2019s pistols at dawn!\r\n\u2022 HIGH VOLTAGE - Experience the electrifying new scoring system that turns up the intensity on every frame. Strike fear into your opponent\u2019s heart!\r\n\u2022 A VISUAL FEAST - Exquisite 3D lane designs and buttery-smooth ball physics that make every roll feel true to life.\r\n\u2022 FAST AND FURIOUS - Unlock increasingly powerful bowling balls with fun, lovingly hand-crafted designs.\r\n\u2022 CONQUER ALL - Battle, hook, and smash your way through intense PvP matches and win to level up through the ranks and strive to claim your place in the mighty Unicorns league!\r\n\u2022 SWEET PRIZES - Earn tickets for wins in the Arcade game modes and spend them on cool rewards, including epic avatars and gear.\r\n\r\nJoin the bowling revolution and download Bowling Fury now to become king of the lanes!\r\n\r\nIN APP PURCHASES\r\nBowling Fury is free to download. However, this game includes optional in-game purchases (including random items), available to purchase with real money. If you don\u2019t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your device settings.\r\n\r\nThis game requires an internet connection and contains third party advertising.",
    "descriptionHTML": "From the award-winning studio behind Darts of Fury and Ping Pong Fury, Bowling Fury is here to revolutionize the way you play 10-pin bowling on your phone/tablet. Whether you&#39;re a seasoned pro or just looking to knock down some pins for fun, our exciting new online multiplayer bowling simulator game offers a vibrant, modern take on the classic sport cherished by millions around the globe.<br><br>You&#39;ve never seen a bowling game quite like this before! Head into the world of Bowling Fury and enjoy a fast-paced PvP experience like no other! <br><br>KEY FEATURES<br><br>\u2022 LEAGUE MODE - Traditional rules and authentic scoring with a fresh vibrant retro look. Perfect for those who love the classic feel of the game.<br>\u2022 SHOOTOUT - Fire up a fast-paced, head-to-head match where every strike and spare counts with a brand-new head to head scoring system designed for thrill-seekers. It\u2019s pistols at dawn!<br>\u2022 HIGH VOLTAGE - Experience the electrifying new scoring system that turns up the intensity on every frame. Strike fear into your opponent\u2019s heart!<br>\u2022 A VISUAL FEAST - Exquisite 3D lane designs and buttery-smooth ball physics that make every roll feel true to life.<br>\u2022 FAST AND FURIOUS - Unlock increasingly powerful bowling balls with fun, lovingly hand-crafted designs.<br>\u2022 CONQUER ALL - Battle, hook, and smash your way through intense PvP matches and win to level up through the ranks and strive to claim your place in the mighty Unicorns league!<br>\u2022 SWEET PRIZES - Earn tickets for wins in the Arcade game modes and spend them on cool rewards, including epic avatars and gear.<br><br>Join the bowling revolution and download Bowling Fury now to become king of the lanes!<br><br>IN APP PURCHASES<br>Bowling Fury is free to download. However, this game includes optional in-game purchases (including random items), available to purchase with real money. If you don\u2019t want to use this feature, please disable in-app purchases in your device settings.<br><br>This game requires an internet connection and contains third party advertising.",
